# Keep the Docker build context small. The only Dockerfile in this repository
# (test/deploy/basic/Dockerfile) copies bin/* and test/deploy/basic/* only, so
# nothing of what is ignored below is needed to build an image. In particular,
# bin/ is NOT ignored: it holds the main binary and the four test helpers that
# the image copies into the container.

# Version control and CI
.git
.github

# Cargo build outputs (sources are not needed in the image)
rust/target
rust/fuzz/target

# Documentation not needed in the image
*.md
docs
rust/docs
configs

# Local caches, coverage and logs
coverage.*
*.log
tools/build
AGENTS.md
